{"strings": [
  {"text":"27 August. Wind north. Today I am forty. Nobody knows.","translation":"8월 27일. 북풍. 오늘 나는 마흔이 되었다. 아무도 모른다.","where":"worlds/moominpappa-at-sea/scenes/round-room/elements/wall_a.js"},
  {"text":"Ate bread. Whose, I don't know.","translation":"빵을 먹었다. 누구 것인지는 모른다.","where":"worlds/moominpappa-at-sea/scenes/round-room/elements/wall_a.js"},
  {"text":"Calm. The sea is good today.","translation":"잔잔함. 오늘은 바다가 좋다.","where":"worlds/moominpappa-at-sea/scenes/round-room/elements/wall_a.js"},
  {"text":"Ice on the steps. Wind north.","translation":"계단에 얼음. 북풍.","where":"worlds/moominpappa-at-sea/scenes/round-room/elements/wall_a.js"},
  {"text":"Fog. Heard a ship. It did not come.","translation":"안개. 배 소리를 들었다. 오지 않았다.","where":"worlds/moominpappa-at-sea/scenes/round-room/elements/wall_a.js"},
  {"text":"Wind south-west. Nobody again.","translation":"남서풍. 또 아무도 없다.","where":"worlds/moominpappa-at-sea/scenes/round-room/elements/wall_a.js"},
  {"text":"23 August. Arrived.","translation":"8월 23일. 도착.","where":"worlds/moominpappa-at-sea/scenes/round-room/elements/wall_a.js"},
  {"text":"Depth: more than the rope.","translation":"깊이: 밧줄보다 깊음.","where":"worlds/moominpappa-at-sea/scenes/round-room/elements/wall_a.js"},
  {"text":"27 August. Calm.","translation":"8월 27일. 잔잔함.","where":"worlds/moominpappa-at-sea/scenes/round-room/elements/wall_a.js"},
  {"text":"The Round Room","translation":"둥근 방","where":"worlds/moominpappa-at-sea/scenes/round-room/scene.json title"},
  {"text":"The round room at the foot of the lighthouse.","translation":"등대 아래층의 둥근 방.","where":"worlds/moominpappa-at-sea/scenes/round-room/scene.json caption"}
]}
